From fd053c26d6b9416883a06c8b5f052c782ceadb5f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JackZR86 <110781504+JackZR86@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:43:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(scanner): separate Room batch save errors from SAF query
 errors

- Distinguish SAF provider exceptions from Room batch database errors in LocalFolderScanner.processDirectory()
- Propagate Room/SQLite exceptions directly without recording false DIRECTORY_READ_ERROR
- Preserve parent directory in pending_directories upon batch transaction failure for subsequent retry
- Update test29 to assert Room exception propagation, absence of false errors, and successful scan retry completion
---
 AndroidBackup_Phase1B2_Scanner_Inventory.zip  | Bin 163017 -> 163523 bytes
 .../app/data/scan/LocalFolderScanner.kt       |  23 ++++++++++++++++--
 .../app/data/scan/LocalFolderScannerTest.kt   |  21 +++++++++++++---
 ...droidBackup_Phase1B2_Scanner_Inventory.zip | Bin 163017 -> 163523 bytes
 src/zipData.ts                                |   6 ++---
 5 files changed, 41 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

